{"id":"662520","name":"西红柿炒鸡蛋","author":"青梅果果儿","authorId":"11412049","desc":"","cover":"images/662520/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"三个"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/662520/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西红柿改十字刀。","img":"images/662520/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"开水烫皮。","img":"images/662520/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"西红柿剥皮（开水烫后更好剥皮或者用水煮一下）。","img":"images/662520/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"西红柿切小块备用。","img":"images/662520/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋打散备用。","img":"images/662520/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放猪油。","img":"images/662520/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"猪油加热融化。","img":"images/662520/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/662520/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻碎成小块。","img":"images/662520/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装盘备用。","img":"images/662520/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油热放番茄碎。","img":"images/662520/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加一小勺盐，上锅盖焖一分钟。","img":"images/662520/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋。","img":"images/662520/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻炒均匀，放一点点酱油。","img":"images/662520/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"完成，装盘即可。","img":"images/662520/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"忘记拍装盘照片了。\n拌饭喷香。\n开炫。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}